# Legacy BACKUP_DIR. backup.sh now defaults outside the checkout, but an
# operator can still point it here — and a config archive carries AUTH_SECRET.
# No trailing slash: the pattern must also match before the directory exists,
# so `git check-ignore backups` answers correctly on a fresh clone.
backups
# Agent scratch (session notes, local settings) — never part of a release.
.claude
# Editor / per-machine local state: only the user's GLOBAL ignore file kept
# these out so far, which protects nobody else's clone.
.vscode
*.local.json
.playwright-mcp/
# The CLI tarball ships the root license: prepack copies it here, the root file is the only source.
packages/cli/LICENSE
